      "english": "Ben’s Diary – My Mandarin"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一年前的今天，我来到中国。",
      "traditional": "一年前的今天，我來到中國。",
      "pinyin": "yì nián qián de jīn tiān wǒ lái dào zhōng guó",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "那时候，我不会说中文。",
      "traditional": "那時候，我不會說中文。",
      "pinyin": "nà shí hou wǒ bú huì shuō zhōng wén",
      "english": "One year ago today, I arrived in China."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "但是现在我可以用中文和中国人说话了，我真高兴！",
      "traditional": "但是現在我可以用中文和中國人說話了，我真高興！",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì xiàn zài wǒ kě yǐ yòng zhōng wén hé zhōng guó rén shuō huà le wǒ zhēn gāo xìng",
      "english": "At that time, I couldn’t speak Mandarin."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "But now I can use Mandarin to talk to Chinese people. I’m really happy!"
    }
  ],
